{"day":"2026-11-26","items":[{"alias":"FinanceNewsDaily","day":"2026-11-26","html":"<article class=\"g-card card news card--text\" data-cat=\"财经\" data-ch=\"FinanceNewsDaily\"><div class=\"g-card__label\"><span class=\"g-card__who\"><span class=\"source\" data-source=\"FinanceNewsDaily\">华尔街见闻·财经时讯</span><span class=\"cat\">财经</span></span><time datetime=\"2026-11-26T02:00:08+08:00\">02:00</time></div><h2 class=\"card__title\"><a href=\"https://t.me/FinanceNewsDaily/497147\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">道指转涨，此前一度跌2.2%</a></h2><p class=\"card__body\">成分股IBM目前涨 3.3%，Sherwin-Williams涨2.7%，家得宝、Salesforce、耐克涨超2%，Travelers Companies Inc.涨1.9%，雪佛龙涨1.2%，波音涨0.7%，高盛仍然跌超1.2%，微软跌超1.4%，谷歌A跌2.8%，亚马逊跌3.1%，英伟达跌6.1%。\n\n纳斯达克金龙中国指数涨超1%，BOSS直聘涨11.26%，老虎证券涨9.60%，理想汽车涨8.74%，宝尊电商涨8.20%，名创优品涨5.57%。</p><div class=\"card__actions\"><button class=\"g-btn g-btn--text expand\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>展开全文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-chevron-down\"/></svg></button><a class=\"g-btn g-btn--text\" href=\"https://t.me/FinanceNewsDaily/497147\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>阅读原文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-external-link\"/></svg></a><button class=\"icon-btn bookmark\" type=\"button\" data-bookmark=\"{&quot;id&quot;: &quot;99c52887522a64c8b21bdaae791c939c9469cf19156d45ae39d3559993c56dd3&quot;, &quot;title&quot;: &quot;道指转涨，此前一度跌2.2%&quot;, &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://t.me/FinanceNewsDaily/497147&quot;, &quot;source&quot;: &quot;华尔街见闻·财经时讯&quot;, &quot;time&quot;: &quot;2026-11-26T02:00:08+08:00&quot;, &quot;snippet&quot;: &quot;成分股IBM目前涨 3.3%，Sherwin-Williams涨2.7%，家得宝、Salesforce、耐克涨超2%，Travelers Companies Inc.涨1.9%，雪佛龙涨1.2%，波音涨0.7%，高盛仍然跌超1.2%，微软跌超1.4%，谷歌A跌2.8%，亚马逊跌3.1%，英伟达跌6.1%。\\n\\n纳斯达克金龙中国指数涨超1%，BOSS直聘涨11.26%，老虎证券涨9.60%，理想汽车涨8.74%，宝尊电商涨8.20%，名创优品涨5.57%。&quot;}\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"收藏\"><span class=\"ph-bookmark\"><svg